### Public - register a new user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carol@example.com",
  "name": "Carol",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

### Public - login, stores the token for the requests below
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carol@example.com",
  "password": "supersecret"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Public - login as the bootstrapped admin (for the DELETE below)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "changeme"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Public - greeting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/greeting

### Public - health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Authenticated - list users (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users?page=0&size=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Authenticated - get one user by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Authenticated - PATCH (partial update, own account or ADMIN)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carol Renamed"
}

### Authenticated - PATCH email
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "carol.new@example.com"
}

### ADMIN only - delete a user (login as admin first)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/users/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Public - Swagger UI
GET http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html

### Public - OpenAPI JSON
GET http://localhost:8080/v3/api-docs
